For an international organization in Europe, we are urgently looking for a FULL REMOTE (Senior) Java Developer with Liferay knowledge and experience. This is a 100% remote position. Candidates need to be fluent in English.
Candidates need to be able to work the European schedule.
During the corona crisis, interviews will be done through WEBEX, and travel is not required for the interviews. All positions are long-term.

Tasks and Responsibilities:

• Create a utility to import content from the OpenCms to Liferay DXP: Static and structure content; Metadata, taxonomy, and tags; Multilingual content;

• Create multilingual websites; Integrate LDAP, create users, groups roles, and permissions;

• Create themes, layouts, page templates, and fragments (design elements) based on Web Style Guide (Responsive Web Design);

• Create workflows;

• Create user dashboards;

• Develop Liferay custom modules (portlets, hooks) based on application requirements;

• Integrate Google search;

