• Experience with RESTful APIs, Angular, JSON, XML;

• Expert in the Liferay Web Content Management System (CMS) with: Experience working on CMS migrations; Extensive knowledge in Liferay themes and fragments development; Extensive knowledge of Liferay out-of-box features and widgets; Extensive knowledge of Liferay custom modules development and search integration;

• Fluent in English;

Interested :

